<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TJX Q4 EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TJX Q4 EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Friday it lifted its Q4 (January 31, 1997) earnings per share estimate on TJX Cos Inc to $0.76 from $0.74 after the retailer posted nine percent comparable-store sales growth for December, 1.5 percent better than Rodman had expected.</p>
<p>--In a choppy retail environment, Rodman said &quot;this company remains one of the most consistent performers.&quot; It continues to rate TJX as outperform.</p>
<p>--TJX was trading at 45-3/8, off 3/4.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
